omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D_9uJITnVksQ7kNvwE7yOiK&_nc_oc=AdqHJEGiFAo1PRU_jYv-1Z-KzRQm9MGzuyH09btKmXD57G9kqSImbp4TIPAdAznYAWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOfIyrjE609u43nm1btkJfFllAWsz1spxrBy0xfmVnllg&oe=6AC7B534"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GC5noq2-5B0Q7kNvwHqevIs&_nc_oc=AdphxvAJWaF7nIqNRTjmULbkgR7hVUxqkB_Q4wKj_ZAl9ZPHfwPR1V1e2LSCLJ8YAME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNpupX5BVN-i8mLAWRkWy4xkqUG_miNU-iPYncBTWUn-w&oe=6AC7B696"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R5BFpJNNA-gQ7kNvwHk7PIm&_nc_oc=AdpSj04JYCdeWNae8TyFQadfDqKnLicYucw-WIWOxXn-jKol1y52UqC1uUzzX4jRXxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPvUwnTXbn1_-nfcDHei85MFB3cORG0E_IkJueASpLH5w&oe=6AC7CBB7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://